J773g: T8132 PMP and PMP report support, backported to 7.1.13

From GravityLinux/linux replacement/115-pmp (Linux 7.3): pmp-report.c and
pmp-report.h as there; pmp.rs gets the T8132 protocol changes on the 7.1
Rust APIs (port_pmp_rs.py).

